  If you use this software, or the domain-aware synthetic copy-paste
  augmentation method it implements, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  Poultry Monitoring: domain-aware synthetic copy-paste augmentation for
  dense instance segmentation
authors:
  - family-names: Betancur
    given-names: Juan Esteban
repository-code: "https://github.com/Risslock/cv_portfolio"
